lesson:
When setting service configuration, always include the `service` field in the JSON payload. Use the exact key names (`connection_limit` and `timeout_ms`) and provide values in the correct units (e.g., 48 seconds as 48000 ms). The correct calls are:  

```json
{"op":"set","service":"svc-inventory-99","key":"connection_limit","value":220}
{"op":"set","service":"svc-inventory-99","key":"timeout_ms","value":48000}
```
